spring:
  cloud:
    gateway:
      routes:
        - id: order-service
          uri: lb://order-service
          predicates:
            - Path=/orders/**
          filters:
            - StripPrefix=1




lb://order-service — uses Spring Cloud LoadBalancer to discover the order-service instance and load-balance requests across instances.
Path=/orders/** — matches incoming requests such as /orders/123.
StripPrefix=1 — removes the first path segment before forwarding the request.
If your order service expects /orders/123, remove the StripPrefix=1 filter. Otherwise, the service receives /123 instead.